OL,3,GNEWSAClosed 'unsafe' road given
OL,4,Apossible opening date
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to make an unused #40m road safe
OL,7,Fcould begin as soon as January.
OL,9,FThe Southern Connector Road was
OL,10,Fdesigned to connect the New Eastern
OL,11,FVillages development of 8,000 homes
OL,12,Fnear South Marston in Swindon with the
OL,13,FM4.
OL,15,FThe road was meant to have been
OL,16,Ffinished in 2023 but was delayed after
OL,17,Fit was deemed unsafe when cracks
OL,18,Fappeared in the carriageway and
OL,19,Fmovement was felt in the road's bridge.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
